dia-text/]]></Text></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="10" top="1530" width="1300" height="40"><Container color="transparent" alignment="TOP_LEFT"><Text fontSize="24" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL" textAlign="LEFT" softWrap="false" maxLines="1"><![CDATA[滤镜改变绘制结果，不改变布局尺寸。本页对照三种滤镜，并给出可复现交付的自检纪律。]]></Text></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="10" top="1570" width="1300" height="40"><Container color="transparent" alignment="TOP_LEFT"><Text fontSize="24" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL" textAlign="LEFT" softWrap="false" maxLines="1"><![CDATA[sigmaX/sigmaY 对子树结果做高斯模糊；Parser 版自动按 sigma 提供模糊输出边界，嵌进]]></Text></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="10" top="1610" width="1300" height="40"><Container color="transparent" alignment="TOP_LEFT"><Text fontSize="24" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL" textAlign="LEFT" softWrap="false" maxLines="1"><![CDATA[ColorFiltered 时无需手配 outputBounds。]]></Text></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="10" top="1650" width="1300" height="40"><Container color="transparent" alignment="TOP_LEFT"><Text fontSize="24" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL" textAlign="LEFT" softWrap="false" maxLines="1"><![CDATA[color 加 blendMode 对子树应用颜色混合，作用范围由子树绘制边界决定，合法溢出与阴影也包含在]]></Text></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="10" top="1690" width="1300" height="40"><Container color="transparent" alignment="TOP_LEFT"><Text fontSize="24" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL" textAlign="LEFT" softWrap="false" maxLines="1"><![CDATA[内。]]></Text></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="10" top="1730" width="1300" height="40"><Container color="transparent" alignment="TOP_LEFT"><Text fontSize="24" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL" textAlign="LEFT" softWrap="false" maxLines="1"><![CDATA[模糊的是背后已绘制的内容，用来做毛玻璃；背后没有内容时没有可见效果，通常配 ClipRect 或]]></Text></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="10" top="1770" width="1300" height="40"><Container color="transparent" alignment="TOP_LEFT"><Text fontSize="24" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL" textAlign="LEFT" softWrap="false" maxLines="1"><![CDATA[ClipRRect 限定区域。]]></Text></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="10" top="1810" width="1300" height="40"><Container color="transparent" alignment="TOP_LEFT"><Text fontSize="24" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL" textAlign="LEFT" softWrap="false" maxLines="1"><![CDATA[四层验证由稳到脆：布局断言、像素采样、Golden 比对、人工 Artifact；采样点避开抗锯齿边缘。]]></Text></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="10" top="1850" width="1300" height="40"><Container color="transparent" alignment="TOP_LEFT"><Text fontSize="24" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL" textAlign="LEFT" softWrap="false" maxLines="1"><![CDATA[可复现：固定字体与 Surface、网络图转本地、不把时间或随机数写进图。]]></Text></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="10" top="1890" width="1300" height="40"><Container color="transparent" alignment="TOP_LEFT"><Text fontSize="26" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD" textAlign="LEFT" softWrap="false" maxLines="1"><![CDATA[ImageFiltered：子树高斯模糊]]></Text></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="10" top="1930" width="1300" height="40"><Container color="transparent" alignment="TOP_LEFT"><Text fontSize="26" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD" textAlign="LEFT" softWrap="false" maxLines="1"><![CDATA[ColorFiltered：子树颜色混合]]></Text></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="10" top="1970" width="1300" height="40"><Container color="transparent" alignment="TOP_LEFT"><Text fontSize="26" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD" textAlign="LEFT" softWrap="false" maxLines="1"><![CDATA[BackdropFilter：背景高斯模糊]]></Text></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="10" top="2010" width="1300" height="40"><Container color="transparent" alignment="TOP_LEFT"><Text fontSize="26" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD" textAlign="LEFT" softWrap="false" maxLines="1"><![CDATA[自检与可复现交付]]></Text></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="10" top="2050" width="1300" heigh